\bibitem[Cui et~al.(2026)Cui, Huang, and Abeynayake]{cui2026edo}
Xia Cui, Ziyi Huang, and N.~R. Abeynayake.
\newblock Ensemble diversity optimization for subjective supervision.
\newblock \emph{arXiv preprint arXiv:2607.08493}, 2026.
\newblock cs.LG; submitted 9 Jul 2026. Jointly optimizes ensemble weights, effective cardinality, and calibration via Gumbel-Softmax + signed diversity regularizer. Reduces cross-entropy 40-78% vs Soft-CE / Soft-MD / Top-5 Voting / WEL baselines. We cite as the most recent ensemble-with-calibration baseline; CRV differs by operating under an explicit adversarial (capture) model rather than a passive disagreement model.

